N2  - : SYNOPSIS: This literature review examines the research that has gone into the use of psilocybin specifically to treat depression. An examination of the available evidence demonstrates significant promise in psilocybin's efficacy to treat depression, although more research is needed to make the results generalizable., (C) 2022 Relias Media, All rights reserved.
