T1  - Psilocybin-assisted psychotherapy for treatment resistant depression: a randomized clinical trial evaluating repeated doses of psilocybin

A1  - Rosenblat JD
A1  - Meshkat S
A1  - Doyle Z
A1  - Kaczmarek E
A1  - Brudner RM
A1  - Kratiuk K
