T1  - Psilocybin With Pimavanserin Compared to Psilocybin Alone for the Treatment of Major Depressive Disorder
T2  - Investigating the Role of Serotonin in the Mechanism of Action of Psilocybin in Patients With Major Depressive Disorder


Y1  - 2024//
Y2  - 2024//
N2  - In this study, the researchers want to probe the role of the 5-HT2A receptor in mediatingthe subjective effects of psilocybin. While previous studies have shown that blockage ofthe 5-HT2A receptor reduces the psychedelic experience in humans, an animal studyrevealed that blockage of the 5- HT2A receptor abolished the psychedelic effects withoutaffecting the antidepressant response. This suggests that the pathway responsible for theantidepressant response is dissociated from the psychedelic experience pathway, which ismediated by 5-HT2A signaling.
