T1  - Corrigendum to ‘Single-dose psilocybin-assisted therapy in major depressive disorder: a placebo-controlled, double-blind, randomised clinical trial’ (eClinicalMedicine (2023) 56, (S2589537022005387), (10.1016/j.eclinm.2022.101809))

A1  - von Rotz R
A1  - Schindowski EM
A1  - Jungwirth J
