T1  - Corrigendum to "Chronic psilocybin administration increases sociability and alters the gut microbiome in male wild-type mice but not in a preclinical model of obsessive-compulsive disorder" [Neuropharmacology 279 (2025) 110648].
T3  - International Journal of Neuropharmacology
A1  - Gattuso, James J
A1  - Kong, Geraldine
A1  - Bezcioglu, Bilgenur
A1  - Lu, Da
A1  - Ekwudo, Millicent N
A1  - Wilson, Carey
