T1  - Personality change in a trial of psilocybin therapy vs escitalopram treatment for depression-Corrigendum.
A1  - Weiss, Brandon
A1  - Ginige, Induni
A1  - Shannon, Lu
A1  - Giribaldi, Bruna
A1  - Murphy-Beiner, Ashleigh
A1  - Murphy, Roberta
A1  - Baker-Jones, Michelle
